borrow: StoreVsLiveLoad: main: store to a region invalidates a load of that region whose value is still used afterwards (store overwrites a region whose loaded value is still used)
borrow: DanglingPointerDeref: main: dereference of a pointer whose underlying alloca is no longer in scope or has been freed (load through pointer loaded from memory (possible dangling))
borrow: DoubleBorrow: main: mutable borrow taken while an immutable borrow of the same region is still live (mutable store while immutable load is live)
borrow: 3 violation(s)
